---
layout: layouts/base.njk
locale: en
title: "Contact Us & Start Your File | Downwinders Advocates"
description: "Contact our dedicated team of RECA advocates by phone, text, or online form to begin your family's claim review."
permalink: /contact/
---
<section class="sec" id="contact">
  <div class="wrap stack">
    <div style="text-align:center;max-width:800px;margin:0 auto">
      <p class="eyebrow">Direct Advocate Access</p>
      <h1>Get In Touch With Our Team</h1>
      <p class="lede">Whether you are ready to file or just have a few questions about your family's history, we are here to provide clear, honest guidance.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="ways" style="max-width:860px;margin:var(--sp2) auto 0;width:100%">
      <div class="way">
        <h3>Call Us Directly</h3>
        <a class="big" href="tel:{{ site.phoneTel }}">{{ site.phoneDisplay }}</a>
        <p class="muted">Speak with an intake specialist. Available Monday through Friday, 8am – 6pm MT.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="way">
        <h3>Text Us Anytime</h3>
        <a class="big" href="sms:{{ site.phoneTel }}">{{ site.phoneDisplay }}</a>
        <p class="muted">Fast and convenient. Text us your questions and we will respond promptly.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="way" id="booking">
        <h3>Make An Appointment</h3>
        <a class="big" href="{{ site.discoveryBookingUrl or '#form' }}">Schedule Online</a>
        <p class="muted">30-minute phone or Zoom consultation with an account specialist.{% if not site.discoveryBookingUrl %} (PLACEHOLDER — Andy discovery booking URL.){% endif %}</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    {# Same First / Last / Email / Phone fields as Check Eligibility (manager notes). #}
    <div class="form-card" id="form" style="max-width:860px;margin:var(--sp3) auto 0;width:100%">
      <h2 style="font-size:24px;color:var(--navy)">Start Your Family's File or Send a Message</h2>
      <p class="muted">Same contact fields as Check Eligibility. We will call you within one business day.</p>

      <form action="/contact/" method="POST" class="stack" style="margin-top:var(--sp2)" id="contact-lead-form">
        <div class="form-grid-2">
          <div class="field">
            <label for="c_fname">First Name *</label>
            <input type="text" id="c_fname" name="fname" required autocomplete="given-name" placeholder="Jane">
          </div>
          <div class="field">
            <label for="c_lname">Last Name *</label>
            <input type="text" id="c_lname" name="lname" required autocomplete="family-name" placeholder="Doe">
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="form-grid-2">
          <div class="field">
            <label for="c_email">Email Address *</label>
            <input type="email" id="c_email" name="email" required autocomplete="email" placeholder="jane.doe@example.com">
          </div>
          <div class="field">
            <label for="c_phone">Phone Number *</label>
            <input type="tel" id="c_phone" name="phone" required autocomplete="tel" placeholder="(801) 555-0123">
          </div>
        </div>

        <button class="btn" type="submit" style="align-self:flex-start;font-size:18px;padding:14px 32px">Submit Request &rarr;</button>
        <p class="legal placeholder" role="status">PLACEHOLDER — Andy: wire Contact leads (First / Last / Email / Phone). Do not duplicate Subscribe list members. Current Lawmatics website callback is name / phone / best-time only and is kept below as a temporary option.</p>
      </form>

      <div style="margin-top:var(--sp3);padding-top:var(--sp2);border-top:1px solid var(--rule)">
        <h3 style="font-size:17px;color:var(--navy);margin-bottom:8px">Or request a quick callback</h3>
        <p class="muted">Temporary Lawmatics embed (name, phone, best time) until the 4-field Contact form is wired.</p>
        {% include "partials/lawmatics-callback.njk" %}
      </div>
    </div>

    <div style="text-align:center;max-width:760px;margin:var(--sp3) auto 0">
      <p class="muted">
        <strong>Phone:</strong> <a href="tel:{{ site.phoneTel }}">{{ site.phoneDisplay }}</a>
        &middot; <strong>Email:</strong> <a href="mailto:{{ site.email }}">{{ site.email }}</a><br>
        <strong>Address:</strong> {{ site.address }}
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
